WEBVTT

00:08:58.462 --> 00:09:03.036
so I had had enough hymnals
and crosses to last me a lifetime.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.307
Several lifetimes, actually.

00:09:05.331 --> 00:09:07.865
But my friend assured me
that he wasn't Catholic,

00:09:07.889 --> 00:09:09.318
nor were most of his students,

00:09:09.342 --> 00:09:12.099
but he took his classes
there every spring.

00:09:12.123 --> 00:09:16.862
And as he had it,
even the most restless, distractible,

00:09:16.886 --> 00:09:20.896
testosterone-addled
15-year-old Californian boy

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:24.132
only had to spend three days in silence

00:09:24.156 --> 00:09:28.386
and something in him cooled
down and cleared out.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.695
He found himself.